@Finance.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5178

### Health Check
GET {{Finance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

### Register (Web - recebe Access JWT no JSON e Refresh Token em Cookie HttpOnly)
POST {{Finance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:5173

{
  "name": "Lucas Dev",
  "email": "lucas.dev@exemplo.com",
  "password": "SenhaForte123!",
  "clientType": "web",
  "deviceName": "VS Code REST Client"
}

### Login (Mobile - recebe Access JWT e Refresh Token no JSON)
# @name mobileLogin
POST {{Finance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lucas.dev@exemplo.com",
  "password": "SenhaForte123!",
  "clientType": "mobile",
  "deviceName": "Expo Simulator"
}

### Refresh (Web - envia Cookie HttpOnly + X-Client-Type + Origin)
POST {{Finance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
X-Client-Type: web
Origin: http://localhost:5173

### Refresh (Mobile - envia refreshToken no corpo JSON)
POST {{Finance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{mobileLogin.response.body.$.refreshToken}}",
  "clientType": "mobile",
  "deviceName": "Expo Simulator"
}

### Listar sessões ativas
GET {{Finance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{mobileLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Listar Audit Log de segurança (alertsOnly=true filtra falhas, bloqueios, reuso e revogações)
GET {{Finance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/security/audit-logs?page=1&pageSize=20&alertsOnly=false
Authorization: Bearer {{mobileLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Logout (Web - requer X-Client-Type: web + Origin)
POST {{Finance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/logout
X-Client-Type: web
Origin: http://localhost:5173

### Criar conta bancária
# @name createAccount
POST {{Finance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{mobileLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nubank Principal",
  "type": "CHECKING",
  "initialBalance": 2500.00,
  "color": "#ff5a36"
}

### Criar cartão de crédito
# @name createCard
POST {{Finance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/credit-cards
Authorization: Bearer {{mobileLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cartão Pulse Black",
  "creditLimit": 8000.00,
  "closingDay": 18,
  "dueDay": 25,
  "defaultAccountId": "{{createAccount.response.body.$.id}}",
  "color": "#18181b"
}

### Criar compra parcelada no cartão (6x)
# @name createInstallments
POST {{Finance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{mobileLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "creditCardId": "{{createCard.response.body.$.id}}",
  "type": "EXPENSE",
  "description": "Notebook Trabalho",
  "amount": 3000.00,
  "transactionDate": "2026-11-24",
  "installments": 6
}

### Listar parcelamentos ativos
GET {{Finance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/transactions/installment-groups
Authorization: Bearer {{mobileLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Antecipar últimas 2 parcelas para a fatura aberta atual (estilo Nubank, com desconto)
POST {{Finance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/transactions/installment-groups/{{createInstallments.response.body.$[0].installmentGroupId}}/anticipate
Authorization: Bearer {{mobileLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "count": 2,
  "selectionOrder": "FROM_LAST",
  "mode": "MOVE_TO_INVOICE",
  "discountAmount": 15.00
}

### Resumo mensal do Dashboard
GET {{Finance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dashboard/monthly-summary?year=2026&month=11
Authorization: Bearer {{mobileLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
